  m_Text: "The Rhythm Ocean is designed for children aged from 5 to 10. Children
    will learn to recognize four type of music, and enjoy them. \n\nThe Climbing
    Monkey is designed for children aged from 10 to 15. It is more difficult, and
    need some rhythm sensation. \n\nThe Dropping Ink is a little challange, requiring
    a deeper understanding of music."
